            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1248/cpb.c17-00678</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The MeOH extract from dried whole Sedum bulbiferum MAKINO (Crassulaceae) plants yielded 34 compounds, including six new flavonoid glycosides and 28 known compounds. The structures of new compounds were established using NMR, Mass spectroscopic analysis and chemical evidence.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
